tally pervs  with his eyes on the wrong prize Bobby  is left unattended and is viciously  skewered by a boat propeller Ben tries  to warn the boat but it's too late  Lavinia fumes at the counselor  and been for not watching after her son  holding them responsible for his death  this is almost identical to the plot of  Friday the 13th spoiler alert  where mrs. Voorhees goes on a killing  rampage because the counselors were busy  having sex while her son drowned in the  lake back in present-day which for us is  1989 Donna brings a fresh off death row  Brooke back to her hotel room we find  out that Donna used baclofen a muscle  relaxant instead of the regular lethal  injection to trick the prison into  thinking Brooke was dead the detox  however is so painful that Donna has to  tie Brooke up until it passes there's a  fun little nod to Neil Patrick Harris  says Brooke watches him on the 80s  program Doogie Howser  you might remember Neil as Chester CREB  in season fours freak show Donna picks  up some jack-in-the-box please sponsor  me and is told she'll be given a new  passport and identity now that she's  free but Brooke isn't having it the last  time she was with Donna five years ago  she had her strung up as serial killer  bait what's changed well Donna is  looking for redemption she's seen the  error of her ways and wants to make  things right I know there are things  waiting for us when we die I'm just  trying to make sure that I go with the  good things on the other place she does  want to turn out like her father who we  saw in the beginning of episode 5 was a  serial killer now I don't know what you  guys thought but when Donna conveniently  put the app for the camp red would fast  knowing Brooke would read it and make me  think she's pulling some sort of reverse  psychology that she secretly wants  Brooke to come to camp red would but hey  that could just be me when Brooke sees  the ad she knows what she must do kill  Margaret for the five years she spent on  death row and being framed for a  murderer I do have a reason to live it's  to see her die and Brooke didn't even  finish her burger Donna takes Brooke to  a roller rink to let out some steam hell  she's been cooped up for years might at  least have some fun and we get a cheesy  80s style montage of the two of them  enjoying themselves they even have some  licorice whips like the boy ordered in  the beginning hey and for someone who  just got of death row Emma is looking  fine in the back however is a character  closely watching them portrayed by H as  Salaam dylan mcdermott he's been in four  seasons of the show  Murder House asylum apocalypse and now  1984 Brooke reiterates that she's going  back to Redwood nothing is gonna stop  her when Bruce approaches or at least  that's how he introduces himself to the  girls on IMDB and the subtitles his  character is named Alex so he may just  be using an alias here since we'll find  out he's the serial killer that has been  plaguing women along the California  Highway he tells them that his car broke  down outside a roller rink and he needs  a ride to his girlfriend to the festival  they initially say no but when they find  their car doesn't work and he comes to  save the day  they offer to give him a ride and Donna  after waving her no stranger policy says  the best line of the episode once the  guys going under my hood he's not a  stranger anymore damn in the back of the  car bruce seems to be enjoying the  devil's dust and Brooke is immediately  suspicious bruce tells them an urban  legend about a guy who stalks cars in  the night which is likely his way of  telling them that the legend is based  off of him  Brooke feels uncomfortable and demands  he get of the car when a state trooper  pulls up behind them asking if  everything is okay out of the blue Bruce  shoots the officer and decides to get  out of the car giving Donna and Brooke  time to get away let this be a lesson to  everyone out there always pick up  hitchhikers shingles is copycat  wide-load yes that's his actual name  they gave his character is trying to  take a piss just like he did in his  first episode which I guess confirms  that ghosts still have to piss jingles  is ambushed by the other pranksters who  he thought he had killed we learned that  Montana seems to be running the show  telling the others to save their kills  for the big festival as we later learn  when jingles is brought before the dead  Montana's plan is to create a massacre  so large it attracts media attention  from around the world specifically  paranormal investigators who she  believes may be able to help break the  curse that has kept them trapped on the  camp redwood property now the whole gang  is here except for birdy  what gives chef birdy is good people  notice also that Ben's younger brother  isn't there as well  the simplest explanation for that is  that he died before lavinia's death  which supposedly caused the blood curse  which plagues them all however there  could be a world in which it's actually  the spirit of  Bobbe which is causing this curse  jingles tells them that he has come back  to kill Richard Ramirez the man who  killed his wife along with countless  others unlike the other campers Ramirez  has the devil on his side and that's how  the blood curse did not affect him  wandering montage I think one of these  strangest things in this scene is when  jingle starts questioning the ghosts  whether they can feel pain almost like  he's preemptively deciding if he wants  to kill himself like he ends up doing at  the end of the episode jingles learns  that her mother has been chasing around  the counselors because she hates them  for what they did to her boy we also get  a flashback of the first camp redwood  Massacre in which Lavinia killed all the  counselors for revenge when Ben finds  out what she did he runs away and is  stabbed in the leg a wound which has  caused his limp we've seen the entire  season  notice how when he's resurrected at the  very end that his limp is now gone Ben  ends up killing his own mother surmising  her blood had poured into this ground  with her pain and her rage maybe that's  why you're all still stuck here jingles  is spared and taken to the cabin where  Lavinia lives in the woods the cabin  also gives me the shack from Friday the  13 vibes jingles enters and finds a cup  and ball toy which belonged to his  brother now this is either a clue that  Bobby is still alive or it's simply a  memento Lavinia keeps to remind her of  her son but my guess is the latter since  Lavinia tells jingles she felt the  presence of her son in these 70s but was  disappointed when she found out it was  the wrong son Lavinia appears seemingly  with the power to teleport and this is  the worst mother-son fight since I told  my mom I wanted to go to film school  she's a total dick to jingles constantly  berating him for the death of Bobby  telling him that every day for her is  torture she was somewhat dormant for  20-plus years until jingles took the job  as janitor  she spoke into Margaret's ear a girl who  was already quite messed up in the head  and pushed her over the edge to kill the  other counselors it was a double victory  for Lavinia because she got to kill  counselors while destroying the one  thing Ben loved  and I used to destroy you Ben tells her  he's here to kill Ramirez but Lavinia  doesn't really seem to care she's still  mad as hell I will spend every moment  her now to Eternity making sure you burn  at a traffic stop Bruce rams the police  car into them and takes them hostage  when Brooke wakes up she finds that he  has tied Donna up to the back and wants  her to be the one to run her over she  can either hit the gas or get her face  blown off I know which one I'm choosing  his motivations are much like Ramirez to  be remembered telling Brooke that he  hopes to surpass Ted Bundy's kill count  Brooke outsmarts Bruce by smashing the  like button I mean hitting reverse  allowing her the opportunity to steal  his gun and shoot him in the leg Donna  and Brooke tie him up and Brooke goes  hardcore cutting off his thumb so he can  never hitchhike again remember Bruce  Karma's a [ __ ]  Brooke is gonna walk the rest of the way  to Redwood and Donna decides to come  with her while Trevor Margaret and  Courtney worked to put the finishing  touches on the poorly coordinated  festival seriously $1,000 a ticket who  would ever go to a festival for it Oh  Margaret keeps slinging the big dick  jokes come on Margaret hashtag all sizes  matter when the mall from the 80s band  kajagoogoo arrives you may have seen him  in my stranger things video as the voice  of neverending story  [Music]  check out that video if you have a  chance  Trevor ventures off into the woods where  he meets Montana remember back in  episode two he referred to her as his  soul mate so it remains to be seen  whether Montana will be using him for  more than just his meat stick  l'm all ends his never-ending story when  ricky comes to collect a deal he had  made with the devil a superstar career  provided to him by satan himself  Courtney brings a gift basket to the  catch a Cougar's catch a GU catch a  goose to find them all killed this is  seriously gonna impact the festival and  in our final scene jingles hangs by the  dock where his brother died when he's  visited once again by Lavinia he tells  her he thinks about papi every day and  reiterates his desire to kill Ricky  if jingles is gonna stand a chance  against Ricky he'll need to kill himself  now I felt the show could have done a  better job explaining how this all works  but it appears since jingles owes a debt  to Ricky and Satan if he were killed by  them he would be gone for good but if he  kills himself he'll be resurrected at  Camp redwood and become one of the  ghosts jingles feels that if he's going  to stand the best chance of defeating  Ricky and protecting his son he needs to  kill himself resurrecting in front of  his corpse ready to take on Ramirez  that's it for this episode of American  Horror Story make sure to LIKE subscribe  and leave your thoughts and theories in  the comments below you can also follow  me on twitter at things story whitey  until next time remember daddy loves you  very much

